      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug was the “straw that broke the camel’s back” for me, and I was right in feeling so. Well over a year later, this glitch is still here and VRChat has not recognized it. Blaming avatar creators for muscle settings that do nothing was outrageous. The asymmetrical and broken default index poses drive me nuts as both a user and a creator.",
